  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>&bull; What is Screening Alpha ?</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We offer pre-built thematic stock screeners to intermediate investor and investment enthusiasts. Screeners themes vary accross the main investment styles: value / growth (garp) / quality / dividend etc. Our aim is to make high-quality data accessible to as many people as possible.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Pre-built means we are not offering a standard stock screening platform. Instead, as accredited investment professionals, we find it more accessible (and entertaining) to craft highly effective stock screeners<strong> </strong>ourselves<strong> </strong>for our customers.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>&bull; Service description:&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Our offer is subscription base (a membership to Screening Alpha). The membership allows to access the Yearly stock selection (2024) of our screeners. Without membership, the latest stock selection made by our screeners are not visible.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We offer a monthly and an annual membership. Both are engaging the customer over a minimal 12 month period.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>&bull; Other information:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Feel free to email us for more information about the Team behind Screening Alpha if you want more information about the service, the team...</p>\r\n</div>",
